invariant: INV-16
file: src/poly1305_wide.h
catches: diff_poly1305_wide
reason: the step multiplies h1 by r1 in place of s1, 5/4 of r1, in the sum at
  2^0, so the part of h1 r1 past 2^130 is not reduced by 5 and every tag
  is wrong. bin/diff_poly1305_wide compares the limbs with the Lean model's
  block, whose block_mod states the value.

--- old
    ct_u128 d0 = ct_mul128(h0, k->r0) + ct_mul128(h1, k->s1);
--- new
    ct_u128 d0 = ct_mul128(h0, k->r0) + ct_mul128(h1, k->r1);
